functions:
Functions
  function add(a, b) { return a + b }
  function greet(name='world') { ... }
  let inc = function(x) { return x + 1 }
  function f(...) { ... }            defaults must follow required args
  return expr               return a value

control_flow:
Control flow
  if cond { ... } else if cond { ... } else { ... }
  while cond { ... }
  for x in collection { ... }   iterates lists/strings/dicts
  for i, x in enumerate(collection) { ... }
  break / continue

async:
Async & parallel
  async function f() { ... }
  let x = await f()
  PARALLEL { expr1, expr2, expr3 }
